  "instructions": "1. Soak 1 cup toor dhal & 1 cup channa dhal overnight.\n2. Coarsely blend along with green chillies and curry leaves.\n3. Then add onion, grated carrots, chopped cilantro, finely chopped dill leaves, grated ginger, asafetida (hing) & some salt to taste. Mix well.\n4. Form oval shaped dumplings. Steam them.\n5. Serve with chutneys of your choice!",
